", "created_at": "2021-04-21T08:20:11Z", "repo": "university-assignments", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2974f2c4a419c191d8b2cd0dcf20f58c0bbce8d6", "message": "Assignment 1 Questions", "created_at": "2021-04-21T08:19:17Z", "repo": "university-assignments", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3dd0f06afb769b86f7d24ced9cd41f58a996ca05", "message": "Question 1's answer \n\nQ1: Write a program that will define a function which will get an array and the (5)\r\nnumber to be searched. If the number is found in the array, then the function\r\nwill print the message \u201cSearch successful\u201d and the total count of numbers,\r\nelse message \u201cItem not found\u201d will be printed.", "created_at": "2021-04-21T08:18:07Z", "repo": "university-assignments", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "52b1bdddda7452c1d5534f3d4331d118ebf26fe0", "message": "Delete Semester 1", "created_at": "2021-04-21T08:14:47Z", "repo": "university-assignments", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e81b8479c728af02c347ba17a5e6fc8a7093b9e9", "message": "Create Semester 1", "created_at": "2021-04-21T08:14:30Z", "repo": "university-assignments", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "26dc6d3d38371117f1234a722d53d20669e36ca9", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2021-04-21T08:11:56Z", "repo": "university-assignments", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3661845483703b3016bb78c857bae1227ed8ff20", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2022-10-12T02:38:45Z", "repo": "bughunting", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "51f8f207482d37c3c5ef6523409041bae6006e43", "message": "Create swagger-ui-xss.yaml\n\nSwagger Ui DOM XSS through configUrl or url parameters.", "created_at": "2022-10-12T02:36:25Z", "